{"name":"Astra","hex":"#edd5a6","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Astra (name)","blocks":[{"text":"Astra is a female given name."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astra_(name)"},{"title":"Astra, Chubut","blocks":[{"text":"Astra is a town in Chubut Province in southern Argentina and a part of the city and municipality of Comodoro Rivadavia."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astra%2C_Chubut"},{"title":"Astra (missile)","blocks":[{"text":"Astra is a family of Indian all weather beyond-visual-range air-to-air missile (BVRAAM) developed by the Defence Research and Development Organisation for the Indian Air Force and the Indian Navy. Multiple variants of this missile have been developed with engagement range varying from 500 m (0.31 mi) to 340 km (210 mi). Astra Mk-1 has been integrated with the Sukhoi Su-30MKI fleet."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Astra_MK-1_closeup.png/330px-Astra_MK-1_closeup.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Astra_(missile)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Solid_Fuel_Ducted_Ramjet_%28SFDR%29_missile_being_tested_on_8_February_2019.jpg/500px-Solid_Fuel_Ducted_Ramjet_%28SFDR%29_missile_being_tested_on_8_February_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Solid_Fuel_Ducted_Ramjet_%28SFDR%29_missile_being_tested_on_8_February_2019.jpg/1280px-Solid_Fuel_Ducted_Ramjet_%28SFDR%29_missile_being_tested_on_8_February_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Solid_Fuel_Ducted_Ramjet_%28SFDR%29_missile_being_tested_on_8_February_2019.jpg/500px-Solid_Fuel_Ducted_Ramjet_%28SFDR%29_missile_being_tested_on_8_February_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_